        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this prologue, you step into Monster Lab Simulator: Prologue – experience the first steps of becoming the ultimate monster creator and battle master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of synthesizing mysterious essences, hatching rare eggs, and expanding your lab in this limited free version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy mysterious essences to hatch unique Fulus from fragile eggs. Every experiment is a chance to create something new.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden recipes by combining different essences. Unlock surprise creatures and expand your growing collection.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter turn-based battles in the station. Compete in tournaments for big rewards or test your team in free matches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb your creatures to keep them forever in your permanent collection. Store their stats and create powerful combinations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your stored orbs for profit and invest in powerful new machines. Expand your lab, speed up production, and unlock stronger creations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine three Fulus into one evolved form with the merge machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yield, and powerful new battle options.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your playful Fulus out of trouble, look after them when they get mischievous, and make sure your lab stays a place where creatures feel happy and healthy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Monster Lab Simulator delivers the thrill of synthesis and battle, the joy of collection, and the magic of uncovering the unknown all inside your very own monster lab.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this prologue, you step into Monster Lab Simulator: Prologue – experience the first steps of becoming the ultimate monster creator and battle master!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of synthesizing mysterious essences, hatching rare eggs, and expanding your lab in this limited free version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy mysterious essences to hatch unique Fulus from fragile eggs. Every experiment is a chance to create something new.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f421ea54e54f696ae5f8bbf214c4e22c.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden recipes by combining different essences. Unlock surprise creatures and expand your growing collection.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/687f0250ca6c6eaa7e3dea9e9c521f1a.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter turn-based battles in the station. Compete in tournaments for big rewards or test your team in free matches.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/cb8e07d1db1ecf9390d8ae7e29b5ea4d.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orb your creatures to keep them forever in your permanent collection. Store their stats and create powerful combinations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ff6219a74fd2a043f231441ab2e2820f.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your stored orbs for profit and invest in powerful new machines. Expand your lab, speed up production, and unlock stronger creations.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/f22d235b4ea4e1c1ff16de41c3f5d352.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine three Fulus into one evolved form with the merge machine. Unlock stronger abilities, higher essence yield, and powerful new battle options.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/07d082b1b2cdb2ea2db93e57bd9dd7b8.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your playful Fulus out of trouble, look after them when they get mischievous, and make sure your lab stays a place where creatures feel happy and healthy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.poster.avif?t=1774635643\" width=754 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.webm?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036850/extras/ebe369fe49c0368aed5cf5c2d9c75f9c.mp4?t=1774635643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Monster Lab Simulator delivers the thrill of synthesis and battle, the joy of collection, and the magic of uncovering the unknown all inside your very own monster lab.</p>",
